[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_ARTIFACT_RINGS_OF_SCORCHERO]
Rings of Scorchero

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_ARTIFACT_RINGS_OF_SCORCHERO_DESC]
Are they used to destroy the world or protect it, you might have to ask the Ahuizotl yourself.
But at least I know that if you want to move them from one pillar among three to another according to the rules, it might take an exponential amount of time, so the world is safe anyway —
Wait! What are you doing? That’s not the rule! The small ring can’t be placed on top of the big ring! You can’t take several rings at once! Wait! Stop! Don’t move the pillar!

